{title: Maula Mere Lele Meri Jaan}
{artist: Chak De India Salim Sulaiman}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm]Aanna [G]Ha. [D]Wahya [A]ALI,        [Bm]Aanna [G]Ha. [D]Wahya [A]ALI
[D]Teeja [Gm]tera [A]rang tha [D]main to,        [D]jeeya [Gm]tere [A]dhang se [D]main to
[A]Tu hi tha [D]maula [Gm]tu hi [D]aan,        [Gm]Maula mere [C]le le meri [D]jaan
[Gm]Maula mere [C]le le meri [D]jaan,        [D]Tere Sang kheli [G]Holi
[D]Tere [G]Sang Ki Di [D]waali,        [D]Tere Angno ki [G]Chhaya
[D]Tere [G]Sang Saawan [D]Aaya,        Phir le tu [D]chahe nazre
[Gm]chahe [D]chura le,        Laut ke tu [D]aayega re
[Gm]shart la [D]gaa le,        [D]Teeja [Gm]tera [A]rang tha [D]main to
[D]jeeya [Gm]tere [A]dhang se [D]main to,        [A]Tu hi tha [D]maula [Gm]tu hi [D]aan
[Gm]Maula mere [C]le le meri [D]jaan,        [Gm]Maula mere [C]le le meri [D]jaan
